      "id": "GdNjJdujmcAF"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "I chose the freestyle lane, focusing on content performance and search discoverability. I want to investigate how observable characteristics, such as content type and search-position tier, relate to click-through rate (CTR). In my initial exploration of the anonymized dataset, I noticed differences in mean CTR across search-position tiers. I want to investigate these patterns further, account for differences in sample size, and identify findings that could help content editors make more informed review decisions. I chose this question because it combines exploratory data analysis with a practical decision while allowing me to develop my skills in pandas, statistical reasoning, and evidence-based recommendations."
      ],
